<title>UK: Granada says sells Barbados hotel.</title>
<headline>Granada says sells Barbados hotel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK's hotels and leisure group Granada Group Plc said on Monday it had sold its Sandy Lane Hotel in Barbados for 38 million stg.  </p>
<p>The group said in a statement that the hotel has been sold to Sandy Lane Hotel Ltd  which is controlled by International Investment &amp; Underwriting Ltd, Dublin on behalf of Dermot Desmond and J.P. McManus.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
